{"id":"db7ec154138d5972","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-term.md","title":"Term","display":"df-term — Term","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-term","aliases":["58-df-term"],"display":"df-term — Term","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-term"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-term</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-term — Term"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L,R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\mathrm{Var}_S,H,T\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L,R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\mathrm{Var}_S,H,T\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TermHierarchy}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\mathrm{TermSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{TermHierarchy}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\mathrm{TermSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term}\\vdash\\mathrm{TermHierarchy}_S(H,\\mathcal L,\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\leftrightarrow\\exists R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Var}_S\\cap(R\\cup F\\cup C)=\\varnothing\\land \\mathrm{Function}(H,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(H))\\land H(0)=\\mathrm{Var}_S\\cup C\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\left(H(k+1)=H(k)\\cup\\{\\langle f,s\\rangle:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;(f\\in F\\land\\operatorname{ar}(f)=n\\land s\\in H(k)^n)\\}\\right)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term}\\vdash\\mathrm{TermHierarchy}_S(H,\\mathcal L,\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\leftrightarrow\\exists R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Var}_S\\cap(R\\cup F\\cup C)=\\varnothing\\land \\mathrm{Function}(H,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(H))\\land H(0)=\\mathrm{Var}_S\\cup C\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\left(H(k+1)=H(k)\\cup\\{\\langle f,s\\rangle:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;(f\\in F\\land\\operatorname{ar}(f)=n\\land s\\in H(k)^n)\\}\\right)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term}\\vdash\\mathrm{TermSet}_S(T,\\mathcal L,\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\leftrightarrow\\exists H\\;\\left(\\mathrm{TermHierarchy}_S(H,\\mathcal L,\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\land T=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}H(k)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term}\\vdash\\mathrm{TermSet}_S(T,\\mathcal L,\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\leftrightarrow\\exists H\\;\\left(\\mathrm{TermHierarchy}_S(H,\\mathcal L,\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\land T=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}H(k)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>保留原有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle f,s\\rangle\">\\(\\langle f,s\\rangle\\)</span> 应用编码和三元接口。本文件定义的是该编码的层级及其并；没有改变为其他标记树编码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 是定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 的集合函数，其共同余域是集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(H)\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(H)\\)</span>，不是作为集合使用的真类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>58-df-formula — 一阶公式</li>\n<li>58-df-atomic-formula — 原子公式</li>\n<li>58-df-free-variable — 自由变元</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L,R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\mathrm{Var}_S,H,T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TermHierarchy}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\mathrm{TermSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term}\\vdash\\mathrm{TermHierarchy}_S(H,\\mathcal L,\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\leftrightarrow\\exists R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Var}_S\\cap(R\\cup F\\cup C)=\\varnothing\\land \\mathrm{Function}(H,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(H))\\land H(0)=\\mathrm{Var}_S\\cup C\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\left(H(k+1)=H(k)\\cup\\{\\langle f,s\\rangle:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;(f\\in F\\land\\operatorname{ar}(f)=n\\land s\\in H(k)^n)\\}\\right)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term}\\vdash\\mathrm{TermSet}_S(T,\\mathcal L,\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\leftrightarrow\\exists H\\;\\left(\\mathrm{TermHierarchy}_S(H,\\mathcal L,\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\land T=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}H(k)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle f,s\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}(H)","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1825,"backlinks":[{"id":"732c8884db2d0c67","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"cou